// expect: check::unknown_name
// A builtin variant passed to a parameter whose type comes from its
// callers has no enum to resolve by: one error at the call, which says to
// write the enum or type the parameter (not also "nothing passes it a
// value" at the parameter).
component Side(e) { row { align: e; text "x" } }
bar Top { edge: top; Side center }
